    "text": "By Laqunta Dixon ,\n6 hours ago TULSA, OKLA. (KTUL) — Tulsa police say dozens of teenagers were involved in disturbances downtown late Friday night, leading to multiple detentions and arrests. Around 11:45 p.m. on February 7, officers stopped five juveniles near 100 North Greenwood for violating the city’s downtown curfew. One of the teens... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 17",
